{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9496536790043740608,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Unifying try-except and try-finally",
      "source_hash": 14957033118456748477,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "try-except와 try-finally의 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723080Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 7406908027281762435,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP proposes a change in the syntax and semantics of try statements to allow combined try-except-finally blocks.",
      "source_hash": 4488819292449443904,
      "context_hash": 4698129011394220385,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 try-except-finally 블록을 결합할 수 있도록 try 문의 구문과 의미에 변경을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This means in short that it would be valid to write",
      "source_hash": 12661480783075407335,
      "context_hash": 15026600974565651413,
      "translation": "이는 요약하자면 다음과 같이 작성하는 것이 유효해진다는 것을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale/Proposal",
      "source_hash": 6343077935408219565,
      "context_hash": 15243061010049559482,
      "translation": "근거/제안",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There are many use cases for the try-except statement and for the try-finally statement per se; however, often one needs to catch exceptions and execute some cleanup code afterwards.",
      "source_hash": 728720013714032850,
      "context_hash": 1340702624583936360,
      "translation": "try-except 문과 try-finally 문 자체에는 많은 사용 사례가 있지만, 예외를 잡고 이후에 정리 코드를 실행해야 하는 경우가 흔히 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is slightly annoying and not very intelligible that one has to write",
      "source_hash": 16463325283602610458,
      "context_hash": 15525414396984398860,
      "translation": "다음과 같이 작성해야 한다는 것은 다소 성가시고 그다지 이해하기 쉽지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "So it is proposed that a construction like this",
      "source_hash": 3237974167456549537,
      "context_hash": 15417667905121611648,
      "translation": "그래서 다음과 같은 구성이",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "be exactly the same as the legacy",
      "source_hash": 9188542869191275778,
      "context_hash": 16231674093899913450,
      "translation": "기존의 다음 구성과 정확히 동일하게 되도록 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "This is backwards compatible, and every try statement that is legal today would continue to work.",
      "source_hash": 2079259576112658366,
      "context_hash": 5067684332647450589,
      "translation": "이는 하위 호환성을 유지하며, 오늘날 유효한 모든 try 문은 계속 동작할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Changes to the grammar",
      "source_hash": 6850393899813423884,
      "context_hash": 6867414725502495925,
      "translation": "문법 변경 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The grammar for the try statement, which is currently",
      "source_hash": 15054598350983899977,
      "context_hash": 12422685270752805666,
      "translation": "현재의 try 문 문법은",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "would have to become",
      "source_hash": 15521107290863049365,
      "context_hash": 9907931398687923047,
      "translation": "다음과 같이 바뀌어야 할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 11922928628228504550,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "As the PEP author currently does not have sufficient knowledge of the CPython implementation, he is unfortunately not able to deliver one.",
      "source_hash": 10278028196597131149,
      "context_hash": 10550036804399069173,
      "translation": "이 PEP의 저자는 현재 CPython 구현에 대한 충분한 지식을 갖고 있지 않으므로, 아쉽게도 구현을 제공할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Thomas Lee has submitted a patch [2]_.",
      "source_hash": 1792982493792142434,
      "context_hash": 3260563393303445253,
      "translation": "Thomas Lee가 패치 [2]_\\ 를 제출했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:28:26.723086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "However, according to Guido, it should be a piece of cake to implement [1]_ -- at least for a core hacker.",
      "source_hash": 926871142746488282,
      "context_hash": 5189775904280400514,
      "translation": "하지만 귀도에 따르면, 적어도 핵심 해커에게는 이를 구현하는 [1]_ 것이 식은 죽 먹기여야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:32.555005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This patch was committed 17 December 2005, SVN revision 41740 [3]_.",
      "source_hash": 14947879370175259757,
      "context_hash": 3595436034614019947,
      "translation": "이 패치는 2005년 12월 17일에 커밋되었으며, SVN 리비전 41740 [3]_ 입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:32.555009Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
